# Purpose

This knowledge base is designed to evolve over time through real work, reflection, and execution.

# Domains

## domain_01
- name: Learnings
- objective: Capture key lessons from work, experiments, and outcomes.
- cadence: weekly

## domain_02
- name: Proposals
- objective: Track proposal ideas, drafts, decisions, and outcomes.
- cadence: per-proposal

## domain_03
- name: Travel and Meetings
- objective: Record insights, commitments, follow-ups, and relationship context.
- cadence: per-event

## domain_04
- name: Playbooks
- objective: Document repeatable approaches for common scenarios.
- cadence: monthly-review

## domain_05
- name: Runbooks
- objective: Maintain operational steps for known tasks and incidents.
- cadence: after-change

## domain_06
- name: Delivery Issues
- objective: Record blockers, root causes, mitigations, and prevention actions.
- cadence: per-issue

## domain_07
- name: Soft Skills Learnings
- objective: Track communication, influence, collaboration, and feedback learnings.
- cadence: biweekly

## domain_08
- name: AI Adoption
- objective: Capture AI usage patterns, impact, risks, and adoption opportunities.
- cadence: weekly

## domain_09
- name: Planning
- objective: Keep goals, priorities, and execution plans aligned with outcomes.
- cadence: weekly

## domain_10
- name: Projects
- objective: Track project goals, milestones, risks, dependencies, outcomes, and retrospective learnings.
- cadence: weekly

## domain_11
- name: Skills Development and Improvement
- objective: Add new skills, improve existing skills, and track progression through practice and feedback.
- cadence: weekly

## domain_12
- name: Research
- objective: Capture research questions, findings, references, experiments, and implications for decisions.
- cadence: weekly

# Entry Template

Use this template for any new entry.

## entry_template
- id: entry_yyyy_mm_dd_xx
- domain: one-of-domains
- title: short-title
- date: YYYY-MM-DD
- context: what happened
- decision_or_learning: core insight or decision
- action_items:
  - owner: Person
    action: clear next step
    due_date: YYYY-MM-DD
- status: open|in-progress|done
- evidence_links:
  - optional-reference

# Evolution Rules

## rule_01
- name: Add Before Memory Fades
- detail: Add notes within 24 hours of significant events.

## rule_02
- name: Weekly Consolidation
- detail: Consolidate raw notes into clear insights every week.

## rule_03
- name: Monthly Pruning
- detail: Archive stale content and keep active guidance concise.

## rule_04
- name: Outcome Traceability
- detail: Every major learning should connect to an action or decision.

