# How to Use This Knowledge Base

## Creating a New Proposal
1. Create folder: `knowledge/proposals/YYYY-MM_[topic-name]/`
2. Copy `proposal_template.md` → rename to `proposal_[topic].okf`
3. Fill out all sections (business context, solution, trade-offs, learning/introspection)
4. Add entry to "Proposals Index" above with status and key info
5. Link to related proposals/projects

## Creating a New Project
1. Create folder: `knowledge/projects/YYYY-MM_[topic-name]/`
2. Copy `project_template.md` → rename to `project_[topic].okf`
3. Link to the approved proposal that spawned this project
4. Add entry to "Projects Index" above
5. Update status weekly
6. On completion, fill retrospective and move to "Completed Projects"

## Weekly Discipline
- Update active project statuses
- Fill in "Learning & Introspection" sections during the week (not just at end)
- Capture domain knowledge gaps and learnings real-time

## Monthly Discipline
- Review all active proposals/projects
- Look for patterns in what's working/not working
- Update learning archive

## Quarterly Discipline
- Deep review of all proposals and projects completed that quarter
- Write quarterly learning summary
- Identify skill development priorities for next quarter

## Annual Discipline
- Full retrospective on the year's proposals and projects
- Capture biggest learnings about domain, organization, and yourself
- Set focus areas for next year

