# Starter Backlog

## backlog_01
- domain: Proposals
- title: Capture your first proposal (choose something you're working on now)
- priority: high
- action: Create `proposals/2026-07_first-proposal/proposal_[topic].okf` using template

## backlog_02
- domain: Projects
- title: Capture your first active project (choose something in-progress now)
- priority: high
- action: Create `projects/2026-07_first-project/project_[topic].okf` using template

## backlog_03
- domain: Learning
- title: Do first weekly introspection (Friday, 30 min) - capture what went well, what you missed
- priority: high
- action: Fill "Learning & Introspection" sections in your active project

## backlog_04
- domain: Learning
- title: Do first monthly review (last Friday of month) - identify patterns across proposals/projects
- priority: medium
- action: Review all entries, capture 3-5 patterns or insights

## backlog_05
- domain: Skills Development
- title: Identify 3 domain knowledge gaps to prioritize for next quarter
- priority: medium
- action: After first 2-3 proposals/projects, analyze where you struggled with domain knowledge

## backlog_06
- domain: Research
- title: Quarterly learning review - write Q3 2026 learnings summary
- priority: medium
- action: At end of Q3, synthesize what you learned across all proposals/projects
